{"model":"gpt-4o-mini","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-php-class\": \"Cognesy\\\\Instructor\\\\Extras\\\\Maybe\\\\Maybe\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"hasValue\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\",\n            \"description\": \"True if value extracted, false if data not available\"\n        },\n        \"value\": {\n            \"type\": [\n                \"object\",\n                \"null\"\n            ],\n            \"x-title\": \"User\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"name\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"age\": {\n                    \"type\": \"integer\"\n                }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n                \"name\",\n                \"age\"\n            ],\n            \"x-php-class\": \"User\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"description\": \"Correctly extracted values of User\"\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Obligatory if no value extracted - provide reason\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"hasValue\"\n    ]\n}\n\nReturn the result inside a fenced `json` code block."},{"role":"user","content":"We have no information about our new developer."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024}